{"id":"b3eb7df177180e9d","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-laver-reflecting.md","title":"Supercompactness Measure Characterization","display":"thm-laver-reflecting — Supercompactness Measure Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-laver-reflecting","aliases":["58-thm-laver-reflecting"],"display":"thm-laver-reflecting — Supercompactness Measure Characterization","depends_on":["[[58-df-supercompact-cardinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-laver-reflecting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-laver-reflecting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-laver-reflecting — Supercompactness Measure Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"623edb148c120615\" href=\"?note=623edb148c120615\" title=\"58-df-supercompact-cardinal\">58-df-supercompact-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f2438fc1d12482c4\" href=\"?note=f2438fc1d12482c4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure\">58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-laver-reflecting-—-Laver-Reflecting\">thm-laver-reflecting — Laver Reflecting</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,U\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,U\\in V\\)</span> (supercompact cardinal, cardinal target, and measure candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Supercompact}\">\\(\\operatorname{Supercompact}\\)</span> (supercompact-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"623edb148c120615\" href=\"?note=623edb148c120615\" title=\"58-df-supercompact-cardinal\">58-df-supercompact-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S\\)</span> (normal fine <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete measure predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}laver\\text{-}reflecting}\\vdash\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}laver\\text{-}reflecting}\\vdash\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed statement is the normal-fine-measure instance of supercompactness, not a stationarity-reflection theorem.</li>\n<li>Normality, fineness, ultrafilterhood, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness are all supplied by the exact three-place upstream predicate.</li>\n<li>Laver's separate theorem constructs a preparation making supercompactness indestructible under suitable directed-closed forcing.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-laver-reflecting-—-Laver-Reflecting","text":"thm-laver-reflecting — Laver Reflecting","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-supercompact-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"623edb148c120615","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-supercompact-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure","status":"resolved","id":"f2438fc1d12482c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-supercompact-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"623edb148c120615","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Supercompact}$ (supercompact-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-supercompact-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Supercompact}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}laver\\text{-}reflecting}\\vdash\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,U).","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4272","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-laver-reflecting.md|58-thm-laver-reflecting]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["623edb148c120615","f2438fc1d12482c4","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}